  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e09-scene-09",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "在门外守了一下午  (Keeping Watch All Afternoon)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "chun_yuqiao": "淳于乔",
    "bu_xiaogu": "布小谷"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Stepping outside Xingtian at dusk, Chun Yuqiao finds Bu Xiaogu still sitting by the entrance where she has been keeping watch all afternoon. Listen to their Mandarin conversation.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你一个人坐在这儿干吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我在这儿坐一会儿，顺便看看。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你在这儿看什么呀？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "是杏子姐让我过来看看的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你在这儿待多久了？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "没多久，我下午路过这儿的时候，看见闻思默老师了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "他一脸不太高兴的样子，说要找你，我就留下来看看。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你从下午待到现在，你是不是傻呀，还是太闲了？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我也不知道是怎么回事。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "赶紧进去吧，你的脚怎么了？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "没事，就是坐久了有点麻。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你的脚真的没事啊？要不去医院看一下吧。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你一个人坐在这儿干吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What are you doing sitting out here by yourself?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我在这儿坐一会儿，顺便看看。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I am just sitting here for a bit and taking a look around.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你在这儿看什么呀？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What are you looking at out here?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "是杏子姐让我过来看看的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Xingzi asked me to come over and check.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你在这儿待多久了？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'How long have you been staying out here?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "没多久，我下午路过这儿的时候，看见闻思默老师了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Not long; when I walked past this afternoon, I saw Wen Simo.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "他一脸不太高兴的样子，说要找你，我就留下来看看。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'He looked rather unhappy and said he was looking for you, so I stayed to check.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你从下午待到现在，你是不是傻呀，还是太闲了？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You stayed here from the afternoon until now—are you being silly, or do you have too much free time?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我也不知道是怎么回事。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I do not really know why either.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "赶紧进去吧，你的脚怎么了？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Hurry inside; what happened to your foot?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "没事，就是坐久了有点麻。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'It is fine; my leg just went a little numb from sitting.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你的脚真的没事啊？要不去医院看一下吧。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Is your foot really alright? Maybe you should get it checked at the hospital.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
